WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
As long as I don't die

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:04,090
Your daughter is safe

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,480
This fifty thousand yuan is lent to you personally by me.

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,800
Going to a company is too cumbersome

5
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:11,000
Wait until the end of the river to pick you up and tell you when to go to work

6
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:13,600
It depends on you tomorrow, when is convenient for you?

7
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:20,190
I'll arrange for someone to pick up your brother tomorrow morning

8
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:24,020
The school really said so and everything has been arranged.

9
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:30,410
Then I want to go back to school today to see your brother off.

10
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:35,700
What did Mr. Zhang want to do with you just now? About work.

11
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:40,290
I have found a job and will start work tomorrow as a company assistant

12
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:49,830
That's good. Tingting doesn't have to pay so much for her living expenses.

13
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:51,030
you just got a job

14
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:54,430
I still need money for myself. I have it, but I’m holding it.

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:11,420
Make up for the missed classes slowly. Don't worry. You have to take care of your health. I've got all my things. Let's go. I'll take you to school. Good bro.

16
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:12,780
You have to go to work tomorrow

17
00:01:13,060 --> 00:01:16,460
Will you still live back home in the future? If work requires it, you may live outside.

18
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:20,060
Then we won’t see each other for a long time again?

19
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:28,540
It’s not like I’m back in the army on vacation in this city. I’m here to see you. Don’t lie.

20
00:01:34,070 --> 00:01:38,020
Don't be too tired from work. Remember to eat on time. I know.

21
00:01:38,260 --> 00:01:46,130
You can go back to school
